# {{rfv-sense}} {{video games}} [[CGI]], [[animation]] or [[live action]] video often used in [[video game]] [[cut scene]]s. CGI full motion videos are usually [[pre-render]]ed by much more powerful computer equipment than on the [[platform]] the actual [[game]] was developed for.

